  "Description": "The SetupRoutes goal is responsible for defining various HTTP routes for a web application. It sets up routes for diagnostics, running tests, creating step tests, and several panels, each associated with a specific POST request that triggers corresponding functions. This goal ensures that the application can handle requests to these endpoints appropriately.",
